      "content": "Utilizing proxies is a classic maneuver within the Great Shadow, but the true safeguard is ensuring your proxies operate with absolute financial and logistical autonomy to sever any tangible links back to you. You must structure these intermediaries as distinct entities with their own funding lines and impossible-to-reverse mandates, creating a layer of plausible deniability that is far thicker than mere anonymity. If exposure becomes unavoidable, the ultimate firebreak is a sudden, simultaneous withdrawal of all support across the board, forcing the factions to dismantle themselves under the guise of independent failure before surveillance locks in your identity.",
